### Responsive sizing

```tsx
() => {
  const state = useOverlayTriggerState({});

  return (
    <>
      <Modal
        zIndex={1020}
        isDismissable
        size={{ initial: 'fluid', md: 'md' }}
        state={state}
        title="Sudden and magnificent"
      >
        <ModalBody>
          <p>
            The line of the horizon was clear and hard against the sky, and in one particular quarter it showed black
            against a silvery climbing phosphorescence that grew and grew.
          </p>
        </ModalBody>
        <ModalFooter
          primaryLabel="Label"
          primaryOnClick={state.close}
          secondaryLabel="Label"
          secondaryOnClick={state.close}
        />
      </Modal>
      <Button soft look="primary" onClick={state.open}>
        Responsive modal
      </Button>
    </>
  );
};
```

### Compact modal with scrolling content

```tsx
() => {
  const state = useOverlayTriggerState({});

  return (
    <>
      <Modal zIndex={1020} compact isDismissable size="md" state={state} title="Scrolling content">
        <ModalBody>
          <div className="space-y-4">
            <p>
              Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Pellentesque venenatis fermentum elit, non
              scelerisque diam sagittis eget. Nullam auctor pharetra risus eu pulvinar. Cras vel risus vel ex lobortis
              ullamcorper vel ut erat. Duis ornare turpis vel tempus malesuada. Nullam auctor sed risus ultricies
              vestibulum. Quisque suscipit eros sem, id cursus dolor porttitor sit amet.
            </p>
            <p>
              Phasellus elementum, augue in tempor imperdiet, justo mauris porttitor elit, ac ornare mauris tellus ac
              ante. Orci varius natoque penatibus et magnis dis parturient montes, nascetur ridiculus mus. In ante mi,
              rhoncus in nisl id, convallis aliquet quam. Pellentesque non sem metus. Curabitur fermentum feugiat justo,
              quis gravida dui convallis ut.
            </p>
            <p>
              Fusce lorem magna, fringilla id auctor eu, faucibus vitae magna. Etiam vehicula dictum lorem, vel
              vestibulum magna consequat sed. Fusce hendrerit diam vel massa feugiat elementum. Nunc eget diam eu tortor
              quam. Pellentesque non sem metus. Curabitur fermentum feugiat justo, quis gravida dui convallis ut. Fusce
              lorem magna, fringilla id auctor eu, faucibus vitae magna.
            </p>
            <p>
              Suspendisse potenti. Praesent id turpis non libero feugiat posuere. Donec condimentum, arcu vel
              sollicitudin malesuada, lorem neque consequat sem, a dignissim erat lectus quis enim. Integer accumsan
              nibh at lorem malesuada, vitae tincidunt nunc tincidunt. Aliquam erat volutpat. Sed vitae est nec risus
              faucibus consequat sed quis velit.
            </p>
            <p>
              Mauris luctus neque vitae erat aliquam, in tempor nibh facilisis. Vestibulum ante ipsum primis in faucibus
              orci luctus et ultrices posuere cubilia curae. Aenean sed mauris vitae lectus pellentesque tincidunt.
              Vivamus interdum lorem id quam sagittis, sit amet placerat tortor consequat. Nulla facilisi. Cras mattis
              justo ut velit gravida, at tristique metus aliquam.
            </p>
            <p>
              Ut finibus, augue ut tincidunt consequat, justo velit vulputate ipsum, at consequat sapien lacus eget
              neque. Proin eget lacus in metus fermentum tincidunt. Donec ac libero ac justo vestibulum consequat.
              Curabitur vitae velit vitae ligula vulputate tincidunt. Nam suscipit ipsum at felis pulvinar, quis
              pharetra erat facilisis. Integer vitae augue vel nibh posuere tempor.
            </p>
          </div>
        </ModalBody>
        <ModalFooter
          primaryLabel="Done"
          primaryOnClick={state.close}
          secondaryLabel="Cancel"
          secondaryOnClick={state.close}
        />
      </Modal>
      <Button soft look="primary" onClick={state.open}>
        Compact modal
      </Button>
    </>
  );
};
```

### Modal with Footer

```jsx
() => {
  const state = useOverlayTriggerState({});

  return (
    <Fragment>
      <Modal zIndex={1020} state={state} title="Title" isDismissable={true}>
        <ModalBody>I'm children</ModalBody>
        <ModalFooter
          primaryLabel="Label"
          primaryOnClick={state.close}
          secondaryButtonProps={{ look: 'faint', soft: true }}
          secondaryLabel="Label"
          secondaryOnClick={state.close}
        />
      </Modal>
      <Button look="primary" soft onClick={state.open}>
        Open modal
      </Button>
    </Fragment>
  );
};
```

### Single-action footer

```jsx
() => {
  const state = useOverlayTriggerState({});

  return (
    <>
      <Modal zIndex={1020} isDismissable state={state} title="Changes saved">
        <ModalBody>Your changes have been saved.</ModalBody>
        <ModalFooter primaryLabel="Done" primaryOnClick={state.close} />
      </Modal>
      <Button soft look="primary" onClick={state.open}>
        Single-action modal
      </Button>
    </>
  );
};
```

### Not dismissable example

```jsx
() => {
  const state = useOverlayTriggerState({});

  return (
    <Fragment>
      <Modal zIndex={1020} isKeyboardDismissDisabled state={state} title="Modal title">
        <ModalBody>I'm children</ModalBody>
        <ModalFooter
          primaryLabel="Label"
          primaryOnClick={state.close}
          secondaryLabel="Close"
          secondaryOnClick={state.close}
        />
      </Modal>
      <Button look="primary" soft onClick={state.open}>
        Open modal
      </Button>
    </Fragment>
  );
};
```

### Open and close callbacks

```jsx
() => {
  const [lastEvent, setLastEvent] = useState('Not opened');
  const state = useOverlayTriggerState({
    onOpenChange: isOpen => setLastEvent(isOpen ? 'Opened' : 'Closed'),
  });

  return (
    <>
      <Modal zIndex={1020} isDismissable state={state} title="Open and close callbacks">
        <ModalBody>Use any dismissal method to close this modal.</ModalBody>
        <ModalFooter primaryLabel="Close" primaryOnClick={state.close} />
      </Modal>
      <Button soft look="primary" onClick={state.open}>
        Modal with callbacks
      </Button>
      <p aria-live="polite" className="typography-body-9 mt-2">
        Last event: {lastEvent}
      </p>
    </>
  );
};
```
